            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Files and code review

Browse local changes in the Files tab with a per-file diff viewer, and review pull requests with clearer checkout and branch controls.

## More reliable conversations

Keep pull request selection aligned with the active conversation, see which engines are available for your setup, and use the standardized Antigravity connection.
]]></description>
